<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Glimm et al. (2014) & Ho et al. (2019) avian feather bud hexagonal array & traveling competence wave — Code-to-model traceability: 64/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Header docstring cites Glimm et al. (2014) and Ho et al. (2019), but lacks explicit mappings to the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_019_avian_feather_bud_hexagonal.lean` and the experimental perturbation panels (Fc-chEDA1, Ecto-D2, Latrunculin, scaleless)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py L1–L10: Minimal baseline header without Lean 4 theorem or perturbation figure mappings <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py#L1-L10>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Glimm et al. (2014) & Ho et al. (2019) avian feather bud hexagonal array & traveling competence wave — Model fidelity to source: 62/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the linear Keller-Segel + FGF20 dispersion relation (L27-49) and a single 2D dermal chemotaxis + FGF20/BMP4 PDE integration (L52-97), but omits sequential row-by-row phase pinning metrics, simultaneous global competence (v_w -> inf), *scaleless* FGF20-null (chi = 0), and Latrunculin mechanical blockade controls." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py L52–L97: Single-regime 2D solver without v_w sweep, simultaneous competence, or scaleless/Latrunculin controls <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py#L52-L97>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

