<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Glimm et al. (2014) & Ho et al. (2019) avian feather bud hexagonal array & traveling competence wave — MorphoEval overall 52.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py` (56.0/100). The v1 baseline computes the Keller-Segel / FGF20 linear dispersion curve and integrates a single 2D dermal chemotaxis + FGF20/BMP4 PDE regime at one wave speed (v_w = 0.22), but omits Voronoi polygon-class P_6 and bond-orientational |psi_6| lattice order analysis, omits the traveling-wave vs simultaneous-competence (Fc-chEDA1 / exogenous FGF flooding, v_w -> inf) comparison, omits Ecto-D2 wave narrowing, omits *scaleless* (FGF20-null, chi = 0) and Latrunculin mechanical ablation controls, and performs zero computer-vision segmentation on the vendored Gallus gallus dorsal feather tract specimen image. Overall 52.9/100 (faithfulness 47.4, reproducibility 65.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 3cb5ea9; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 38, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 46, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 64, Reproducibility package 65. Output judged: docs/media/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal_comparison.png: rendered output of 2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py at 3cb5ea9, image/png, 321710 B, 1997×624 px, artifact_sha256 664c2117a860f19f7f99ed8d09c4cb5a082a7fafb17dd93b9deb26564682392e (sha256 664c2117a860f19f7f99ed8d09c4cb5a082a7fafb17dd93b9deb26564682392e), spec_fingerprint 97f8b6d41437bf22798c0eb2f411aef0516b204ccaeaa4edce5a129ec128b370. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 97f8b6d41437bf22798c0eb2f411aef0516b204ccaeaa4edce5a129ec128b370; artifact_sha256: 664c2117a860f19f7f99ed8d09c4cb5a082a7fafb17dd93b9deb26564682392e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal_reference.json=06d930a05c4f2cee..., datasets/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal/chick_feather_bud_hexagonal_specimen.jpg=ce18b1c0e01ecb20..., datasets/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal/paper_citations.bib=9d17147a43097e6e..., datasets/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal/scout_manifest.json=1ff38c1e609c69ea...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 dataset files, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 quantitative morphometrics with uncertainty statistics and negative-control contrast, expose full CLI flags, and upgrade the comparison figure to an 8-panel publication synthesis.",
        "remediation needed: Implement automated computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal/chick_feather_bud_hexagonal_specimen.jpg` (Ho et al. 2019 PLOS Biol. 17:e3000132 Fig. 3): extract all 24 feather primordia in Panel B, construct their Voronoi tessellation and Delaunay neighbor graph (P_6 = 0.750, P_567 = 1.000, |psi_6| = 0.5265, NN spacing CV = 0.1974), and quantify the E6.5+24h -> E6.5+48h feather tract expansion ratio in Panel A.",
        "remediation needed: Implement the *scaleless* (`sc/sc`, FGF20-null, chi = 0.0 < chi_c) mutant and Latrunculin A / Blebbistatin actomyosin motility blockade (chi = 0.01 < chi_c) negative controls, plus a chemotactic sensitivity sweep across chi in [0, 0.32] verifying the critical threshold chi_c.",
        "remediation needed: Upgrade the 2D dermal chemotaxis + FGF20/BMP4 + EDA traveling competence wave solver to explicitly resolve row-by-row half-period phase pinning (Delta_y = lambda_y/2, Delta_x = (sqrt(3)/2)*lambda_y) and sweep wave speed v_w from optimal row-by-row propagation (P_6 >= 0.85, |psi_6| >= 0.82) to simultaneous global competence (v_w -> inf, Fc-chEDA1 / exogenous FGF flooding, P_6 approx 0.45-0.55) and Ecto-D2 wave retardation (v_w = 0.5x WT, narrowed tract)." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.29e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

